# restore-at-rest: from the menu, load the saved game the fallrestore session writes (on the
# platform at (9,6), facing north), run north off its edge and, while still falling, restore it
# (Ctrl+R, Enter, slot I). The player stands where the game was saved, unhurt; without it the
# fall's motion carries into the restored game, which slides the player north and hurts them
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
10000 down w
11000 up w             # released first: a held key can take the place of the R
11050 down ctrl
11200 key r
11350 up ctrl
12700 key enter        # slot I
20000 move 160 100
